{
  "_readme": "Event sources scraped daily by scripts/scrape/index.mjs. Set enabled:false to pause one. Adapter types: jsonld, rss, ical, localist, tribe, ticketmaster, seatgeek, nineteenhz, roundups. See docs/SOURCES.md.",
